  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "To limit the options patients see, edit the visit types: go to **Scheduling > Visit Types**, select each restricted procedure type, and clear the **Available Online** checkbox. Only visit types that remain checked will appear in the web widget. Also verify that only providers with active schedules and rooms are enabled under **Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability** and **Settings > Facility > Rooms**."
}
